# 11. SIGNATURE AUDIO — GOOLINGOO-INSPIRED HORROR MELODY

The sound design is one of the most important parts of this game.

Approximately half of the horror experience should come from audio and silence.

Use a traditional Mongolian folk-inspired musical atmosphere based on the requested Goolingoo melody.

Do not use an unauthorized copyrighted recording.

